        "name": "Prosperity",
        "html": "<h3 id=\"prosperity\">Prosperidade</h3>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-prosp-0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-prosp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-prosp-0\"> <span>-1  O equipamento é <em>tosco</em></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-prosp-1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-prosp-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-prosp-1\"> <span>+0</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-prosp-2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-prosp-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-prosp-2\"> <span>+1  <em>x</em> = 1 perfurante</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-prosp-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-prosp-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-prosp-3\"> <span>+2  <em>x</em> = 2 perfurante</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-prosp-4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-prosp-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-prosp-4\"> <span>+3  <em>x</em> = 3 perfurante</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
