      "monsters": {
        "name": "Monsters",
        "html": "<h3 id=\"monsters\">Monstros</h3>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Feras ariscas: <strong>javalis</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Grande Mata</a>, <strong>ursos- das-cavernas</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Grande Mata</a>, <strong>drakes de gelo</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-whitefang-mountains.html\" data-slug=\"the-whitefang-mountains\" data-ref=\"page\" >As Montanhas Presa-Branca</a>, <strong>macacos-da-montanha</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-whitefang-mountains.html\" data-slug=\"the-whitefang-mountains\" data-ref=\"page\" >As Montanhas Presa-Branca</a>, <strong>bisões</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Grande Mata</a></li><li>Predadores: <strong>pássaros-carniceiros</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Grande Mata</a>, <strong>onças</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Grande Mata</a>, <strong>drakes emplumados</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Grande Mata</a> ou <strong>lobos</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Grande Mata</a></li><li><strong>Espíritos do ermo</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"spirits-of-the-wild.html\" data-slug=\"spirits-of-the-wild\" data-ref=\"page\" >Os Espíritos do Ermo</a></li><li><strong>Fae</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"fae.html\" data-slug=\"fae\" data-ref=\"page\" >Os Fae</a></li><li>Um <strong>hagr</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Grande Mata</a> ou dois, vindos da Grande Mata</li><li><strong>Tulpas</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"rime-lords.html\" data-slug=\"rime-lords\" data-ref=\"page\" >Os Senhores da Geada</a>, ligados a sítios dos Senhores da Geada ou talvez ao Passo da Barreira</li><li><strong>Quimeras</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"green-lords.html\" data-slug=\"green-lords\" data-ref=\"page\" >Os Senhores Verdes</a> e outros resquícios dos Senhores Verdes</li><li><strong>Fantasmas</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Morte e os Que Não Morrem</a> ou <strong>revenantes</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Morte e os Que Não Morrem</a>, à espreita perto de túmulos antigos, tumbas ou campos de batalha</li><li>Um bosque de <strong>árvores dool</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" data-ref=\"page\" >A Morte e os Que Não Morrem</a> e seus espíritos residentes</li><li>Um <strong>bhoka</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-whitefang-mountains.html\" data-slug=\"the-whitefang-mountains\" data-ref=\"page\" >As Montanhas Presa-Branca</a>, descido das montanhas</li><li>Qualquer fera ou monstro perigoso que seus jogadores disserem que mora nestas colinas</li></ul>",
        "kind": "section"
      }
